{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":12,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 12:1"},"Whoso loveth instruction loveth knowledge: but he that hateth reproof ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," brutish. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 12:2"},"A good ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," obtaineth favour of the LORD: but a man of wicked devices will he condemn. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 12:3"},"A man shall not be established by wickedness: but the root of the righteous shall not be moved. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 12:4"},"A virtuous woman ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a crown to her husband: but she that maketh ashamed ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," as rottenness in his bones. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 12:5"},"The thoughts of the righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," right: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but"]}," the counsels of the wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," deceit. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 12:6"},"The words of the wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," to lie in wait for blood: but the mouth of the upright shall deliver them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 12:7"},"The wicked are overthrown, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," not: but the house of the righteous shall stand. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 12:8"},"A man shall be commended according to his wisdom: but he that is of a perverse heart shall be despised. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 12:9"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["He that is"]}," despised, and hath a servant, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," better than he that honoureth himself, and lacketh bread. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 12:10"},"A righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," regardeth the life of his beast: but the tender mercies of the wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," cruel. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 12:11"},"He that tilleth his land shall be satisfied with bread: but he that followeth vain ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["persons is"]}," void of understanding. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 12:12"},"The wicked desireth the net of evil ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men:"]}," but the root of the righteous yieldeth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["fruit. "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 12:13"},"The wicked is snared by the transgression of ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," lips: but the just shall come out of trouble. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 12:14"},"A man shall be satisfied with good by the fruit of ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," mouth: and the recompense of a man’s hands shall be rendered unto him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 12:15"},"The way of a fool ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," right in his own eyes: but he that hearkeneth unto counsel ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," wise. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 12:16"},"A fool’s wrath is presently known: but a prudent ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," covereth shame. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 12:17"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["He that"]}," speaketh truth sheweth forth righteousness: but a false witness deceit. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 12:18"},"There is that speaketh like the piercings of a sword: but the tongue of the wise ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," health. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 12:19"},"The lip of truth shall be established for ever: but a lying tongue ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," but for a moment. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 12:20"},"Deceit ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," in the heart of them that imagine evil: but to the counsellors of peace ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," joy. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 12:21"},"There shall no evil happen to the just: but the wicked shall be filled with mischief. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 12:22"},"Lying lips ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," abomination to the LORD: but they that deal truly ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," his delight. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 12:23"},"A prudent man concealeth knowledge: but the heart of fools proclaimeth foolishness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 12:24"},"The hand of the diligent shall bear rule: but the slothful shall be under tribute. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 12:25"},"Heaviness in the heart of man maketh it stoop: but a good word maketh it glad. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 12:26"},"The righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," more excellent than his neighbour: but the way of the wicked seduceth them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 12:27"},"The slothful ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," roasteth not that which he took in hunting: but the substance of a diligent man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," precious. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 12:28"},"In the way of righteousness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," life; and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["in"]}," the pathway ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["thereof there is"]}," no death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 12:28"}]}]}
